00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:16.667
-We do this thing every week
where I send out a hashtag,

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.968
and we ask you guys to respond
to that topic.

00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:20.801
This week,
I sent out the hashtag

00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:22.467
"MyFamilyIsWeird".

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:24.801
And I asked you to tweet out
a funny, weird,

00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:27.200
or embarrassing thing
a family member has done

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.701
or said.

00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:31.133
Within minutes, within seconds,
it was a trending topic

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.200
in the U.S..

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
Wonder why.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.534
Thank you all for playing along,
now I thought I'd share

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:38.901
some of my favorite
"#MyFamilyIsWeird" tweets

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:40.167
from you guys.

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:41.300
And there's some weird families
out there.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.467
It's awesome.

